        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "中网之后，她右肩又出了问题。她先退出家乡武汉，再退出日本站，十月十八号又宣布退出香港。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "8c8c6faf86ee1b364579a12b5fb1f5c14e06beb7fe62094061a5f3a7255d8b7c",
      "words_sha256": "3b0a81fd341ca0faeb779d3ed5c398ef356207647c78fca1a355c828c5876821"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:6e9ffc283b9b8dd409aba15c6334bb1bc87b2b467bd60d3772a5b68326628435",
      "request_id": "6e9ffc283b9b8dd409aba15c6334bb1bc87b2b467bd60d3772a5b68326628435",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "221785047b82f0880fc663ee20dd3f1d",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "今年就到这里，先养好伤，备战二零二七年。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "4bcf012dd3414dc8f8deb32903f18453e13d02c2b0dc17e800dae7a315c9d5a7",
      "words_sha256": "f84865d8787c075e84e74cb9071493dc57bfdca5b6a712287fd85437329947d0"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:719bfed21fb39ec3aa7ee223e1d40b7d5a90e743359971de24a782738754374d",
      "request_id": "719bfed21fb39ec3aa7ee223e1d40b7d5a90e743359971de24a782738754374d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "eaa7b6063cc999b8db42cce011af55d9",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "十月十一号，中网女单决赛。郑钦文七比五、六比四击败安德烈耶娃，成为中网二十年来，第一位本土女单冠军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "bc6c38da962371bab8c2cf5cb5154ef0eacb14e541f8a3551c87ffccc961f40d",
      "words_sha256": "51557152255c8353fec386757582d3d47c720da10ad04f046c1f5201da66adc8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:8e5482b900d4e591624543b0bb6b34c43e519d2626daf9e90a5d783998ebb73c",
      "request_id": "8e5482b900d4e591624543b0bb6b34c43e519d2626daf9e90a5d783998ebb73c",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "46954a462a68b4ae1caa621d4ae5c067",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "可八天后，她宣布：今年不打了。为什么？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "c832fc420e2341a85bf8e9c9551e32a6695f1aeadc6d9fc05601771b80fbe4e5",
      "words_sha256": "5a8521551cf7f9a3009fff264b913810727fe61c83cffbc3772ff32713c65eae"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:9767063ed23120d7b0c269f359090246c03ace32731e268e1801a4d7542682aa",
      "request_id": "9767063ed23120d7b0c269f359090246c03ace32731e268e1801a4d7542682aa",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ebeed47afc1b9f8a7918c564440eb6bb",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "先看这次中网。她是拿外卡进的正赛，一共打了七场，前四场场场打满三盘。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "1cc19ef54f03e50539b81bdcf84ec671b64d20c43de5c874cc26d394735be201",
      "words_sha256": "73c6ebd68e54a63324cea5a287363073dcee546dafa865abcbed654032aaf119"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:988f78a6cfdb311e2ab302ad5eb6431ca8d0979c5b5f5afcb37ce86ed121ed39",
      "request_id": "988f78a6cfdb311e2ab302ad5eb6431ca8d0979c5b5f5afcb37ce86ed121ed39",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "91c567d3c35aa6eba33ef070569cd70c",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "拼下冠军，再停下来养伤。换你，会这么拼吗？评论区说说。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "47edba69df33b16dae23b9c95c56a22c898277a875c97adf320b2be8bdcf79c6",
      "words_sha256": "b429d50d008900d2b1e746fcbf26aafe67e26ef250022fe75f9f6b056c15e905"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:add829992639ba5e02b5a8db3232c470901972fd965661ff27c61a3c6c05fc7b",
      "request_id": "add829992639ba5e02b5a8db3232c470901972fd965661ff27c61a3c6c05fc7b",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "0e08a87fa5db577d3198a8b7cebd80db",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "其实她早就累了。去年温网后，她做了右肘手术；今年美网，她从资格赛一路打进四分之一决赛，接着又为国家队打团体赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "0cc0f5d2cb8560f46bc09e717099a5bdafd9393c21fa82dfac5860ac03608585",
      "words_sha256": "352601fece8dff03e036447efa0905b2e82cbcbbda5cb6d6c6ccdd891940b4f9"
    },
    {
